{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36166","headline":"寄江陵王少府 · 方干","name":"寄江陵王少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分手频曾变寒暑，迢迢远意各何如。\n波涛一阻两乡梦，岁月无过双鲤鱼。\n吟处落花藏笔砚，睡时斜雨湿图书。\n此来俗辈皆疎我，唯有故人心不疎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36166.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36166","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}